"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But just because ⟪k:2⟫I⟪k:3⟫ would be happy with her death...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫doesn’t mean "
"there aren’t people who would be sad to lose her!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mais si moi je serais heureux de sa mort...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫...ça ne veut pas dire que "
